      "value": "Where are the videos hosted? Log should say.\n\nYoutube is in the process of rolling out ad block blocking, and discord is in the process of limiting external links to 24 hour links with a hashed timestamp used to authorize the external to discord uses.\n\nIf it's a world/service like movies and chill, they are behind cloudflare and maybe try visiting the video link in a up to date browser and see if you get a message from cloudflare?",
